            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/dc269649e14c2b8fd2997e1578257975.poster.avif?t=1794079142\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/dc269649e14c2b8fd2997e1578257975.webm?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/dc269649e14c2b8fd2997e1578257975.mp4?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world woven from Essence</h2>For centuries the noble houses of the Empire stewarded the Essences, the primal forces that bind life to the land. Then the Engineering Guild learned to refine Essence into fuel, and magic became a commodity. House Markov grew richer than the Emperor. The Emperor answered with the Unity Law and a political marriage meant to humble them: the Markov heir would wed the youngest child of the Empire's lowest noble house.<br><br>You.<br><br>Before the vows are spoken, your homeland is in flames and you are running for your life. What you become from there is up to you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/8c67cfc3348c4a7ef279321ddf85d8b1.poster.avif?t=1794079142\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/8c67cfc3348c4a7ef279321ddf85d8b1.webm?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/8c67cfc3348c4a7ef279321ddf85d8b1.mp4?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/bf923172f3d849c4005c9935fdf62650.poster.avif?t=1794079142\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/bf923172f3d849c4005c9935fdf62650.webm?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/bf923172f3d849c4005c9935fdf62650.mp4?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full 3D action combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Lock on, strafe, roll, parry and punish. Every fight is real-time and fully 3D.<br></li><li>Light, heavy and charged attack chains across swords, axes, maces, spears, daggers, bows and more.<br></li><li>Class abilities and ultimates that stun, fear, freeze, shield and turn a fight in a single cast.<br></li><li>Fight beside your companions, with bosses that telegraph their blows and punish greed.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/3a5ead5d21d4a4f0a11947de2f1e10f5.poster.avif?t=1794079142\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/3a5ead5d21d4a4f0a11947de2f1e10f5.webm?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/3a5ead5d21d4a4f0a11947de2f1e10f5.mp4?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >15 classes, 45 ways to play</h2>Choose an archetype, then specialise. Be a Shadowblade or a Venomist, a Bulwark or a Warlord, a Druid or an Oracle, a Death Knight, a Beastlord, a Trickster or a Marksman. Each of the 15 classes splits into three specialisations with their own skills and ultimate.<br><br>Then go deeper. Over 160 Essences, from Fire, Water, Air and Earth to the Bear, the Fox and the Crocodile, change how your skills behave. Two characters with the same class rarely play the same way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/07259712511517d0ecc22113552cb112.poster.avif?t=1794079142\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/07259712511517d0ecc22113552cb112.webm?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/07259712511517d0ecc22113552cb112.mp4?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A living, generated empire</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A procedurally generated world of over two thousand places and a hundred cities, each with its own walls, districts, markets and people.<br></li><li>Buy a horse at the stables and ride out into the wilds, or row a skiff along the coast.<br></li><li>Walk into the buildings. Inns, halls and homes have interiors, and townsfolk come and go with their work shifts.<br></li><li>Day and night and the weather change how the world looks, and the seasons turn over a long journey.<br></li><li>When monsters prey on the roads, the cities post bounties to hunt them down.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/75d1eeb441758127237a16bd5c03257b.poster.avif?t=1794079142\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/75d1eeb441758127237a16bd5c03257b.webm?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/75d1eeb441758127237a16bd5c03257b.mp4?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeons, missions and rumours</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take work from the guild hall mission board, chase rumours heard in taverns, and sell what you bring back at the market.<br></li><li>Find delve entrances out in the world and descend into ruined temples, crystal caverns, dwarven halls, desert tombs and infernal depths, each with its own named guardian.<br></li><li>Hire companions at the tavern to fight at your side.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by one developer</h2>Titan Saga is built by Kneeshaw Developments on Godot with a custom C++ world engine. It began life in 2019 as a 2D RPG; it has since been rebuilt from the ground up as the 3D open-world game you see here. If you owned the original, you already own this.",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/dc269649e14c2b8fd2997e1578257975.poster.avif?t=1794079142\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/dc269649e14c2b8fd2997e1578257975.webm?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/dc269649e14c2b8fd2997e1578257975.mp4?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world woven from Essence</h2>For centuries the noble houses of the Empire stewarded the Essences, the primal forces that bind life to the land. Then the Engineering Guild learned to refine Essence into fuel, and magic became a commodity. House Markov grew richer than the Emperor. The Emperor answered with the Unity Law and a political marriage meant to humble them: the Markov heir would wed the youngest child of the Empire's lowest noble house.<br><br>You.<br><br>Before the vows are spoken, your homeland is in flames and you are running for your life. What you become from there is up to you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/8c67cfc3348c4a7ef279321ddf85d8b1.poster.avif?t=1794079142\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/8c67cfc3348c4a7ef279321ddf85d8b1.webm?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/8c67cfc3348c4a7ef279321ddf85d8b1.mp4?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:/