and Earth to the Bear, the Fox and the Crocodile, change how your skills behave. Two characters with the same class rarely play the same way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/07259712511517d0ecc22113552cb112.poster.avif?t=1794079142\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/07259712511517d0ecc22113552cb112.webm?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/07259712511517d0ecc22113552cb112.mp4?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A living, generated empire</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A procedurally generated world of over two thousand places and a hundred cities, each with its own walls, districts, markets and people.<br></li><li>Buy a horse at the stables and ride out into the wilds, or row a skiff along the coast.<br></li><li>Walk into the buildings. Inns, halls and homes have interiors, and townsfolk come and go with their work shifts.<br></li><li>Day and night and the weather change how the world looks, and the seasons turn over a long journey.<br></li><li>When monsters prey on the roads, the cities post bounties to hunt them down.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/75d1eeb441758127237a16bd5c03257b.poster.avif?t=1794079142\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/75d1eeb441758127237a16bd5c03257b.webm?t=1794079142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/659140/extras/75d1eeb441758127237a16bd5c03257b.mp4?t=1794079142\" 